<%# A horizontal, scroll-snapping row of the SAME tiles the indexes use, so a thumbnail's poll cell,
    its right-click menu and its link behave identically here (files-preview.md). One thumbs and
    filemenu controller per row, as the grids do. %>
<div class="tile-row" data-controller="thumbs filemenu" data-thumbs-url-value="<%= thumbnails_files_path %>">
  <%= yield %>
</div>
